OL,3,GNEWSAFour men admit mistreating care
OL,4,Ahome resident
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour care workers have admitted
OL,7,Fmistreating a resident at a home for
OL,8,Fadults with learning difficulties.
OL,10,FA 28-year-old at Broughton House and
OL,11,FCollege, near Lincoln, was taken to
OL,12,Fhospital after suffering non-serious
OL,13,Finjuries, Lincolnshire Police said.
OL,15,FThe men - Ibukun Abati-Sobulo,
OL,16,FInieridiong Jonah, Adans Richard and
OL,17,FSamuel Adebayo - entered guilty pleas
OL,18,Fduring a hearing before Judge Simon
OL,19,FHirst at Lincoln Crown Court on
OL,20,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
